OL,3,GNEWSAWill pigeon mural get its wings
OL,4,Aback?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe owner is calling on the local
OL,7,Fcommunity to help him update its famous
OL,8,Fpigeon mural.
OL,10,FFor more than three decades colourful
OL,11,Fartwork has featured on the side of the
OL,12,Fformer Bridge Bar on Bridge Street in
OL,13,FBanbury, Oxfordshire.
OL,15,FFor many of those years, a huge image
OL,16,Fof a pigeon with its wings spread wide
OL,17,Floomed over the street.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
