OL,3,GNEWSAWill pigeon mural get its wings
OL,4,Aback?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2024, owner of the now Power Cup
OL,7,Fcafe Tomas Kolbus decided the old work
OL,8,Fneeded updating, so brought in artists
OL,9,Fto transform it, controversially
OL,10,Fpainting over the bird.
